UI->what to show user and handles navigation
=>component
=>pages
Hook->to manage state layer and api layer(in state layer hooks see what should be stored and in api layer hooks handle the response )
=>hooks
State->we need to show the users data so to handle or store the data's state we use state layer->data store karne ke liye
=>auth.context.jsx
=>ai.context.jsx
Api->how backend and frontend communicates->how the frontend communicates with the backend apis
=>services
